p=w/'game_readme.txt';s=p.read_text(encoding='utf-8');s+='\nARCHIOSTAL / MALANA: Malana is a new authored Grek Empire system adjacent to Sol and Janira Proxima (101 total destinations). It is accessible with normal warp fuel in Chapters 3 and 4. Look for the station beacon in Malana, select Approach Station, then press F within 360 FU to dock. Explore nine connected wards on foot, or open Ward Transit. WASD/arrow keys move, Shift sprints, Q/E turn, drag to look; F at Starlight Docks boards the ship. The station has a central concourse, diplomatic Nexus-Alpha, Verdant Ward, Lantern Exchange, Aurora Heights, Prism Institute, Starlight Docks, Silverlight Forum and Outer Spiral Echo. Discovery and your walk position persist only with manual Save Game. After claiming Grek Horizon in Chapter 4, Visit Archiostal becomes the next objective. Sol and Janira retain their existing systems, planets and story state.\n';p.write_text(s,encoding='utf-8')
